Changes made in this fork (MPL-2.0):
- EasyList-style ad blocking engine in acr.browser.lightning.adblock.easylist
  (parser, matcher, downloader, composite with the upstream hosts-file blocker).
- Filter list registry (EasyList, RU AdList parts, EasyPrivacy enabled by default;
  EasyList Adult parts behind the "Maximum" toggle).
- Blocked-request counter in TabWebViewClient, shown in the Page Tools sheet.
- Cosmetic (element-hiding) filtering: `##` selectors parsed from the same lists and injected
  as CSS; ad blocker pre-warmed at app start with a readiness gate so the first page is not
  raced against the filter download.
- Ad blocking enabled by default; applicationId changed to com.noads.browser;
  app name changed to "BlockWave".

Third-party filter lists are downloaded at runtime and are NOT included in this
repository. EasyList, EasyPrivacy, RU AdList and EasyList Adult are maintained by
their respective authors (EasyList project). Watching a filter list
does not transfer any rights in this project.
